        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Electronic Attack Squadron 138, Electronic Attack Squadron 137, United States Navy\n- Products: Boeing EA-18G Growler, F/A-18F Super Hornet\n- Places: Naval Air Station Whidbey Island, Washington\n- Topics: Electronic attack, electronic warfare\n\nFacts:\n- Electronic Attack Squadron 138, also known as the Yellow Jackets, is an expeditionary electronic attack squadron of the United States Navy based at Naval Air Station Whidbey Island, Washington.\n- The Boeing EA-18G Growler is an American carrier-based electronic warfare aircraft and a specialized version of the two-seat F/A-18F Super Hornet.\n- Electronic Attack Squadron 137, also known as the Rooks, is a United States Navy electronic attack squadron based at Naval Air Station Whidbey Island, Washington.\n- Electronic Attack Squadron 137 flies the Boeing EA-18G Growler.",
